@startuml
caption <color:#2E7D32>added</color> or <color:#C62828><s>removed</s></color> — the impacted elements only (3 of 12 shown)

title Frontend Logical Architecture - Diff
footer frontend-packages.puml — All folders and their imports are tested against the code by scripts/packages-arch.test.mjs
skinparam shadowing false
' the review page themes this colour for dark mode (--dgm-link)
skinparam hyperlinkColor #1A4FA0
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 20
' the stereotype is the box's folder, relative to petclinic-frontend/, which the test and the
' review page read; it is hidden so the folder is not printed under its name.
' A file belongs to the box with the deepest folder containing it.
' Only production .ts counts (*.spec.ts is skipped, like ArchUnit's DoNotIncludeTests).
' testing/ keeps its box: its stubs are non-spec files, imported by specs alone.
hide stereotype
skinparam ranksep 30
<style>
component {
  BackGroundColor #ECEFF1
  LineColor #546E7A
}
arrow {
  LineColor #78909C
}
</style>
[vets] <<src/app/vets>>
[visits] <<src/app/visits>>
[design-system] <<src/app/design-system>>

[visits] -[#2E7D32,thickness=2]-> [vets]
[vets] --> [design-system]
[visits] -[#2E7D32,thickness=2]-> [design-system]

@enduml
